  - m_Id: 32673007123562496
    m_Localized: A wooden sword. Better than nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894144
    m_Localized: An old clunky sword.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894145
    m_Localized: The easiest textbook weapon to make.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894146
    m_Localized: An old axe that shows signs of use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894147
    m_Localized: Axe with two blades and twice the attack power. In fact, it is said
      not to be twice as strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894148
    m_Localized: Long, thin, pointed sword. Quite light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894158
    m_Localized: A magnificent sword plated in gold. Its striking power is matched
      only by its splendor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894157
    m_Localized: A sharp spear wielded by Odin. Upon closer inspection, I noticed
      the small letters "TM" engraved on it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894155
    m_Localized: A sharp weapon with three blades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894153
    m_Localized: A blunt instrument with a heavy head
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894152
    m_Localized: A sword as heavy as a large blade. It is said that anyone struck
      by it will be crushed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894151
    m_Localized: A long sharp blade made with steel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894149
    m_Localized: A weapon that pierces the opponent with its long reach
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894150
    m_Localized: A weapon with a long, single-edged handle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894154
    m_Localized: A spear that can also be used to control the rear. Its true value
      is revealed when swinging it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894156
    m_Localized: A poisoned dagger that paralyzes the opponent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894163
    m_Localized: When you pull the trigger, an arrow? comes out with a loud noise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894161
    m_Localized: A stick inlaid with a sapphire. It exudes mystical power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894165
    m_Localized: A sacred bow that fires arrows without stopping like storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894159
    m_Localized: A blood-soaked whip with thorns attached. If not handled with care,
      it can injure the user.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894160
    m_Localized: A greatsword said to have been wielded by the monstrous Minotaur.
      Its sheer size and immense weight make it a formidable weapon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894166
    m_Localized: Gauntlets that allow you to control the power of heaven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894164
    m_Localized: A rifle that takes lives in an instant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32673007173894162
    m_Localized: An axe that destroys everything in sight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
